 **Data Structures:**
 The Gaussian set $G$ consists of $G = N_{ctx}HW$ primitives, where $N_{ctx}$ is the number of context views, and $H, W$ are image height and width [S1, unofficial]. Each Gaussian $g$ is defined by:
